### Base Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/api
@token = 

### 0. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Register Admin
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Municipal Admin",
  "email": "admin@dclutter.gov.in",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "password": "Admin@12345",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 2. Login Admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@dclutter.gov.in",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Save Token from Login
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Get Current User Profile (Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get Corporations
GET {{baseUrl}}/geo/corporations

### 5. Get Constituencies
GET {{baseUrl}}/geo/constituencies?corporationId=1

### 6. Get Wards
GET {{baseUrl}}/geo/wards?constituencyId=1

### 7. Lookup Ward by GPS (Spatial Point-in-Polygon)
GET {{baseUrl}}/geo/lookup-ward?lat=12.9716&lng=77.5946

### 8. Get Public Categories with Subcategories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### 9. Get Single Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/6

### 10. Get Public Plants
GET {{baseUrl}}/plants

### 11. Search Plants
GET {{baseUrl}}/plants?search=Seegehalli

### 12. Admin List Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Admin Create Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "E-Waste & Batteries",
  "icon": "fa-battery-full"
}

### 14. Admin List Plants
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/plants
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 15. Admin Create Plant
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/plants
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hebbal Biomethanation Facility",
  "corporationId": 1,
  "constituencyId": 1,
  "address": "Hebbal Kempapura, Bengaluru 560024",
  "latitude": 13.045,
  "longitude": 77.592,
  "status": true
}

### 16. Admin List Vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 17. Admin Register Vehicle (Auto-provisions Driver User in `users` table)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleNumber": "KA-05-MK-9911",
  "vehicleType": "Tipper",
  "capacity": 2.5,
  "driverName": "Suresh Gowda",
  "driverPhone": "9845099887",
  "driverEmail": "suresh.driver@dclutter.gov.in",
  "licenseNumber": "KA0520210009911",
  "constituencyIds": [1, 2],
  "defaultPassword": "1234"
}

### 18. Admin Get Vehicle by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 19. Admin Toggle Vehicle Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/vehicles/1/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
